---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Finance Blog | Tips & Guides" description="Read the latest financial tips, guides, and mathematical breakdowns.">
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Finance Blog</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Deep dives into tax, investing, and financial math.</p>

    <div class="article-list">
      <a href="/blog/how-to-calculate-mortgage-payment" class="article-card">
        <h2>How to Calculate Your Mortgage Payment</h2>
        <p>Learn the exact formula used to calculate mortgage payments and discover strategies to save on interest.</p>
        <span class="read-more">Read Article &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/freelance-tax-guide" class="article-card">
        <h2>The Freelancer's Guide to 1099 Taxes</h2>
        <p>Understand self-employment tax, quarterly payments, and how to avoid a massive IRS bill.</p>
        <span class="read-more">Read Article &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/how-much-life-insurance-do-i-need" class="article-card">
        <h2>How Much Life Insurance Do You Actually Need?</h2>
        <p>Stop guessing. Use the DIME method to calculate the exact amount of coverage your family needs.</p>
        <span class="read-more">Read Article &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/magic-of-compound-interest" class="article-card">
        <h2>The Magic of Compound Interest</h2>
        <p>Albert Einstein called it the 8th wonder of the world. Learn how to use it to build wealth.</p>
        <span class="read-more">Read Article &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/uk-stamp-duty-explained" class="article-card">
        <h2>UK Stamp Duty (SDLT) Explained</h2>
        <p>Everything first-time buyers and home movers need to know about UK Stamp Duty.</p>
        <span class="read-more">Read Article &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px; }
  h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 48px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .article-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
  .article-card { display: block; background: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .article-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: #2563eb; }
  .article-card h2 { margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937; }
  .article-card p { color: #6b7280; }
  .read-more { color: #2563eb; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
